 "notes": "OECD.Stat dataset EO (\"Economic Outlook No 105 - May 2019\"), variable GDPV_ANNPCT, as mirrored by DBnomics (git commit 4782e944f1, 2019-05-27, the first commit holding this edition). OECD.Stat is retired; this mirror is the only machine-readable copy found for this vintage. The last commit for the same edition (a0f724c9a4) holds the same values. Values are annual percent change of real GDP, rounded here to 3 decimals (transcribed values keep the printed 1 decimal). Aggregates (OECD total, euro area) use the composition of the time. The euro area aggregate in the OECD database covers euro area countries that are OECD members (EA16/EA17)."
